Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ installs aioshelly 13.34.1
(github.com/home-assistant-libs/aioshelly, Apache-2.0, Copyright the
aioshelly contributors) from PyPI, with its dependencies (among them
aiohttp, Apache-2.0), in a python:3.12.10-slim container on the tester's
machine, and runs our own script interop/testdata/aioshelly_peer.py
(Apache-2.0) with it. No aioshelly code is included in this repository.

Test data
---------

Every device id, MAC address, name, password, Wi-Fi network, firmware
version, reading, address and URL in the simulator, the tests and
cmd/shellysim is a made-up demo value. Model and type codes are real
model names, chosen to exercise each code path. There are no keys or
credentials.
